sequenceDiagram
  participant RT as Runtime Service
  participant SC as Show Control Service
  participant TD as TouchDesigner
  participant DB as Show Control DB
  participant UI as Gateway / Dashboard

  RT->>SC: previous situation stopped, preparedNext chosen
  SC->>DB: create prepare cueId and ordered actions
  SC->>TD: OSC /td/cue cueId td.environment.prepare payloadId
  TD->>SC: GET payload by payloadId
  SC-->>TD: environmentId, stable asset refs, fixed stage sizes
  SC->>TD: OSC /td/cue cueId td.asset.prepare payloadId
  SC->>TD: OSC /td/cue cueId td.audio.prepare payloadId
  SC->>TD: OSC /td/cue cueId td.webstage.prepare payloadId
  TD-->>SC: lightweight ack media found and audio ready
  SC-->>UI: prepared ready or warning

  RT->>SC: POST go cue for activeSituation
  SC->>DB: create go cue record
  loop ordered actions with optional delayMs
    SC->>TD: OSC /td/cue cueId command payloadId
  end
  Note over SC,TD: GO commands are non-blocking. Show Control does not wait.
  TD-->>SC: async ack received/applied or warning
  SC->>DB: store ack status
  SC-->>UI: live status update
